{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Blop Demo is the beginning of the adventure: you will get introduced with gameplay  and atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Included in this demo:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">8 full levels from the beginning of the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Introduction to key mechanics: potion brewing, object interaction, puzzles</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Interactive Monolith:</strong>Find pieces of the monolith to restore its structure. The monolith reacts to the player's actions and teleport the slime to the next level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781020/extras/monolith.gif?t=1749015552\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Potion Brewing:</strong>Combine ingredients and experiment with different recipes to craft potions for solving puzzles and interacting with the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781020/extras/brewing.gif?t=1749015552\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Level Restart:</strong>If something goes wrong, use the restart potion to reset the current level and try again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781020/extras/restart.gif?t=1749015552\" /></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3781020?t=1749015552","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3781020?t=1749015552","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781020/f080492dd81cd70b9c3fea098d3acdd2d26f06b2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749015552","capsule_imagev